abstract: >-
  玄枢 (MISTVERSE) — my browser-only Chinese metaphysics toolkit. Bazi, Qi Men Dun Jia, Liu Yao, I-Ching, Zi Wei, Tarot, feng shui, 49 small tools. Vue 3 + TypeScript, no backend, no account, no tracking.
